6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=589FUNPAsGIQ7kNvwG4Qduo&_nc_oc=AdpeKYaJrTAE67MqVycLE17P5C4r5eZ323Cbh9UPai_wHoIYycyi0jgpp9vYgpcnEEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw-WD7fEGkG7fAytdxq8HlYKuXhHxQn6G8e0mPjZUChnA&oe=69C1268C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover.png", "id": "853816492160058", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003248_853816495493391_1038613569093630295_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eKqxzDpQdC4Q7kNvwGZlc3L&_nc_oc=AdpdDmVDU9yqttQ_s9zgMW4_TYCF32lH-wkSMatcXY9jPbWmpYI-yELxw5H__uzLP44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx5NK2e6Kh_qVkRtuQhPZAj-PU9cmmTDkviwwK89J_eFA&oe=69C1470E"}, "display_name": "VR Pigeons", "keywords": [], "long_description": "All the world\u2019s a rooftop, and all the men and women merely pigeons. \n\nUse the power of VR and absolutely unique movement controls to slip into your pigeon-self!\nGo out into the world and find a rooftop. Wait for the granny to throw some bread. Eat as much bread as possible! BREAD IS LIFE!\n\n\nHow to become the ultimate VR Pigeon:\n\n\u2022 Channel to your inner Pigeon. Bob your head like a pigeon in order to move around and interact with your world\n\u2022 Unlock and discover four different levels\n\u2022 Protect your bread from other pigeons\n\u2022 Use power-ups and map shortcuts to be faster than other pigeons\n\u2022 Your pigeon enemies come in different shapes, avoid unnecessary conflicts!", "short_description": "All the world\u2019s a rooftop, and all the men and women merely pigeons. \n\nUse the power of VR and absolutely unique movement controls to slip into your pigeon-self!\nGo out into the world and find a rooftop. Wait for the granny to throw some bread. Eat as much bread as possible! BREAD IS LIFE!"}]}, "developer_name": "Maestro Pivetta", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrkiwi.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/VR-Pigeons-EULA.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_u